hadiths[53]{hadithnumber,text}:
"554","[AI-translation] Qabeesah bin Zuaib se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Abu Salamah (Raziyallahu anhu) ki wafat ke baad in ki aankhen band kin."
"555","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Atik se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Abdullah bin Sabit ki iyadat ke liye tashreef lae jab woh beemar the, aur unhen behosh paya. Aap ne unhen pukara magar unhon ne jawab na diya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne inna lillahi padha aur farmaya: 'Aey Abur Rabi! Ham tumhare mamle mein maghloob ho gae.' To aurten cheekhne aur rone lagin. Abdullah bin Atik unhen khamosh karane lage, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Unhen chhod do, jab wajib ho jae to koi rone wali na roe.' Ibn Atik ne poocha: Aey Allah ke Rasool! Kya wajib ho gaya? Aap ne farmaya: 'Jab wafat ho jae.'"
"556","[AI-translation] Amrah se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se suna. Un se zikr kiya gaya ke Abdullah bin Umar kahte hain ke maiyat ko zinda ke rone ki wajah se azab diya jata hai. To Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ne farmaya: Us ne jhoot nahin kaha, lekin us ne ghalti ki ya bhool gaya. Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ek Yahudi aurat ke paas se guzre jis par us ke ghar wale ro rahe the, to Aap ne farmaya: 'Woh is par ro rahe hain jabke use us ki qabr mein azab diya ja raha hai.'"
"557","[AI-translation] Ibn Abi Mulaikah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Usman (Raziyallahu anhu) ki ek beti Makkah mein faut ho gai. To ham us ke janaze mein hazir hone aae, aur wahan Ibn Abbas aur Ibn Umar bhi hazir the. To unhon ne kaha: Main in donon ke darmiyan baitha tha. Pahle main in mein se ek ke paas baitha, phir doosra aaya aur mere paas baitha. To Ibn Umar ne Amr bin Usman se kaha: Kya tum rone se mana nahin karte? Kyunke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Maiyat ko is ke ghar walon ke rone ki wajah se azab diya jata hai.' To Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Umar bhi yahi kahte the ke maiyat ko baaz ghar walon ke rone ki wajah se azab hota hai, phir Ibn Abbas ne hadees bayan ki aur kaha: Main Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ke sath Makkah se wapas aaya yahan tak ke jab ham Baida mein pahunche to ek darakht ke sae mein kuch sawar the. Unhon ne kaha: Jao aur dekho yeh kaun sawar hain? To main gaya to Suhaib the. Unhon ne kaha: Unhen bulao. To main Suhaib ke paas wapas aaya aur kaha: Chaliye aur Ameerul Momineen se miliye. Jab Umar zakhmi hue to main ne Suhaib ko rote suna aur woh kahte: Hae mere bhai, hae mere dost. To Umar ne farmaya: Aey Suhaib! Kya tum mujh par ro rahe ho? Halanke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Maiyat ko is ke ghar walon ke rone ki wajah se azab diya jata hai.' Unhon ne kaha: Jab Umar faut ho gae to main ne is ka zikr Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se kiya. To unhon ne kaha: Allah Umar par raham kare. Nahin, Allah ki qasam! Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne yeh bayan nahin farmaya ke maiyat ko is ke ghar walon ke rone ki wajah se azab diya jata hai. Lekin Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Beshak Allah kafir ko is ke ghar walon ke rone ki wajah se zyada azab deta hai.' To Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ne farmaya: Tumhare liye Quran kafi hai: Aur bojh uthane wala kisi doosre ka bojh nahin uthata [An'am: 164]. Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne us waqt kaha: 'Allah hi hansata aur rulata hai.' Ibn Abi Mulaikah ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Ibn Umar ne kuch nahin kaha."
"558","[AI-translation] Umm Atiyah se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apni beti ko ghusl dene ke waqt farmaya: 'Use teen ya paanch martaba, aur agar tum munasib samjho to is se zyada martaba beri ke patton wale pani se ghusl do, aur aakhir mein kafoor ya kafoor mein se kuch lagao.'"
"559","[AI-translation] Umm Atiyah Ansariyah (Raziyallahu anha) ne kaha: Ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki beti ke baalon ki teen chotiyan banain, peshani ke baal aur do pahluon ki, phir unhen peeche daal diya."
"560","[AI-translation] Abu Ja'far se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko teen martaba ghusl diya gaya."
"561","[AI-translation] Ja'far bin Muhammad se, apne walid se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko qamees mein ghusl diya gaya."
"562","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar se riwayat hai ke Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ko ghusl diya gaya, kafan pahnaaya gaya, aur in ki namaz janaza padhi gai."
"563","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Agar hamen pahle maloom hota jo baad mein maloom hua to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Aap ki biwiyon ke siwa koi ghusl na deta."
"564","[AI-translation] Asma bint Umais se riwayat hai ke Fatimah bint Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne wasiyat ki thi ke jab woh faut hon to unhen woh aur Ali ghusl den. To unhon ne aur Ali ne unhen ghusl diya."
"565","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko teen safed Sahuli kapdon mein kafan diya gaya, in mein na qamees thi aur na amama."
"566","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Tumhare kapdon mein sab se behtar safed hain, tumhare zinda unhen pahnen aur apne murdon ko un mein kafan do.'"
"567","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath the, phir ek aadmi apne oont se gira aur is ki gardan toot gai aur woh faut ho gaya. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Use beri ke patton wale pani se ghusl do aur is ke donon kapdon mein kafan do, aur is ka sar na dhanpo.'"
"568","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Is ka chehra dhanpo aur is ka sar na dhanpo, aur use khushbu na lagao, kyunke woh qayamat ke din talbiyah kahte hue uthaya jaega.'"
"569","[AI-translation] Ibn Shihab se riwayat hai ke Usman bin Affan (Raziyallahu anhu) ne bhi isi tarah kiya tha jo ehram mein faut hone wale ke sath kiya gaya."
"570","[AI-translation] Ibn Abi Saghair se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Uhud ke shuhada ko dekha aur farmaya: 'Main in par gawah hun, unhen in ke khoon aur zakhmon ke sath kafan do.'"
"571","[AI-translation] Abdur Rahman bin Ka'b bin Malik se, Jabir bin Abdullah se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Uhud ke shuhada ki namaz janaza na padhi aur na unhen ghusl diya."
"572","[AI-translation] Anas se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Uhud ke shuhada ki namaz janaza na padhi aur na unhen ghusl diya."
"573","[AI-translation] Isa bin Talhah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham ne Usman bin Affan (Raziyallahu anhu) ko apni walida ke janaze ko donon dandon ke darmiyan uthae dekha aur woh use rakhe tak is se alag na hue."
"574","[AI-translation] Yusuf bin Mahak se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Ibn Umar ko Rafi' ke janaze mein charpai ke donon paon ke darmiyan khade dekha."
"575","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Sabit se, apne walid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) ko Sa'd bin Abi Waqqas (Raziyallahu anhu) ke janaze ko donon lakdi ke darmiyan uthae dekha."
"576","[AI-translation] Abu Aun se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Zubair (Raziyallahu anhu) ko Miswar bin Makhramah ke janaze ko donon lakdiyon ke darmiyan uthae dekha."
"577","[AI-translation] Salim se, apne walid se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam), Abu Bakr, Umar aur Usman (Raziyallahu anhum) janaze ke aage chalte."
"578","[AI-translation] Rabi'ah bin Abdullah bin Hudair se riwayat hai ke unhon ne unhen khabar di ke unhon ne Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ko Zainab bint Jahsh ke janaze ke aage logon se aage dekha."
"579","[AI-translation] Ubaid Maula Sa'ib se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Umar aur Ubaid bin Umair ko janaze ke aage chalte dekha. Phir woh donon aage badh kar baith gae aur baaten karne lage. Jab janaza in ke barabar aaya to woh donon khade ho gae."
"580","[AI-translation] Aamir bin Rabi'ah se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab tum janaza dekho to is ke liye khade ho jao yahan tak ke woh tum se aage badh jae ya rakh diya jae.'"
"581","[AI-translation] Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) janaze ke liye khade hote, phir baith jate."
"582","[AI-translation] Ali bin Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) janaze ke liye khade hote, phir is ke baad baith jate."
"583","[AI-translation] Alqamah se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) khade hue aur hamen khade hone ka hukm diya, phir Aap baith gae aur hamen baithne ka hukm diya."
"584","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne maiyat par chaar takbeeren kahin aur pahli takbeer ke baad Surah Fatiha padhi."
"585","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke woh janaze par pahli takbeer ke baad Surah Fatiha padhte."
"586","[AI-translation] Talha bin Abdullah bin Auf se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) ke peeche janaze ki namaz padhi, to unhon ne Surah Fatiha padhi. Jab salam phaira to main ne in se is ke bare mein poocha. To unhon ne kaha: Sunnat aur haq hai."
"587","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Abi Sa'id se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) ko janaze par Surah Fatiha buland awaz se padhte suna, aur is ke baad unhon ne kaha: 'Main ne yeh is liye kiya taake tum jaan lo ke yeh sunnat hai.'"
"588","[AI-translation] Abu Umamah bin Sahl (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhen Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke Sahaba mein se ek aadmi ne khabar di ke janaze ki namaz mein sunnat yeh hai ke imam takbeer kahe, phir pahli takbeer ke baad aahista awaz se Surah Fatiha padhe, phir Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par durood bheje, aur phir janaze ke liye khuloos se dua kare. Baqi takbeeron mein kuch na padhe, aur phir aahista awaz se salam phaire."
"589","[AI-translation] Ek doosri sanad se Abu Umamah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Dhahhak bin Qais (Raziyallahu anhu) ke qaul ki manind riwayat hai."
"590","[AI-translation] Abu Umamah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke janaze ki namaz mein Surah Fatiha padhna sunnat hai."
"591","[AI-translation] Nafi' se riwayat hai ke Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) janaze ki namaz mein har takbeer ke sath donon hath uthate."
"592","[AI-translation] Nafi' se riwayat hai ke Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) janaze ki namaz ke aakhir mein salam bhi kahte."
"593","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Mas'ud (Raziyallahu anhu) se janaze ki namaz ke bare mein riwayat hai ke is ki na koi waqt ki had hai aur na takbeeron ki tadad ki."
"594","[AI-translation] Abu Umamah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne raat mein faut hone wali ek miskeen aurat ki qabr par janaze ki namaz padhi."
"595","[AI-translation] Abu Umamah bin Sahl bin Hunaif (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhen khabar di gai ke ek miskeen aurat beemar hui to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko us ke beemar hone ki khabar di gai. Umamah kahte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka mubarak mamool tha ke woh beemaron ki iyadat karte aur in ke bare mein poochte. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab yeh aurat faut ho jae to mujhe bhi ittila kar dena.' Logon ne is ka janaza raat mein nikala aur unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko jagana munasib na samjha. Subah jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko is ke bare mein bataya gaya to Aap ne farmaya: 'Kya main ne tumhen hukm na diya tha ke mujhe ittila kar dena?' Sahaba (Raziyallahu anhum) ne arz kiya: 'Ya Rasulullah! Ham ne raat mein Aap ko jagana munasib na samjha.' Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) bahar tashreef lae, aur logon ne is ki qabr par safen banain, aur Aap ne janaze ki namaz padhai aur chaar takbeeren kahin."
"596","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne logon ko Najashi ki wafat ki khabar usi din di jis din woh faut hua. Phir Aap logon ke sath namazgah ki taraf nikle aur in ke sath safen banain, aur chaar takbeeren kahin."
"597","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne logon ko Najashi ki wafat ki khabar usi din di jis din woh faut hua. Phir Aap logon ke sath namazgah ki taraf nikle aur in ke sath safen banain, aur chaar takbeeren kahin."
"598","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Najashi par chaar takbeeren kahin."
"599","[AI-translation] Imran bin Musa se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko sar ki taraf se qabr mein utara gaya."
"600","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko sar ki taraf se qabr mein utara gaya."
"601","[AI-translation] Ja'far bin Muhammad se, apne walid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne maiyat par apne donon hathon se mitti ki teen lapen dalin."
"602","[AI-translation] Ja'far bin Muhammad se, apne walid se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apne bete Ibrahim ki qabr par pani chhidka, aur us par kankariyan rakhin, aur kankariyan hamwar qabr hi par theharti hain."
"603","[AI-translation] Ja'far bin Muhammad se, apne walid se, apne dada se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) faut ho gae aur log taziyat ke liye aae to unhon ne ek kahne wale ko kahte suna: 'Beshak Allah ki taraf se har museebat mein taskeen hai, aur har halak hone wale ka badal hai, aur har guzri hui cheez ka badla hai. To Allah par bharosa karo, aur usi se ummeed rakho. Beshak museebat zada woh hai jo sawab se mahrum ho gaya.'"
"604","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Ja'far se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Ja'far (Raziyallahu anhu) ki shahadat ki khabar aai to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aal Ja'far ke liye khana tayyar karo, kyunke inhen aisi khabar pahunchi hai jo unhen mashghool rakhe gi. Rawi Sufyan ko shak hua."
"605","[AI-translation] Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Main tumhen qabron ki ziyarat se mana karta tha, ab tum un ki ziyarat karo, aur behuda baat na kaho.'"
"606","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Momin ki rooh is ke qarz ki wajah se latki rahti hai yahan tak ke is ki taraf se ada kar diya jae.'"
